WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask about this.
Doing this documentary,

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
you had to talk about yourself
a lot on film.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I hated that.
-But then you had to watch it.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was horrible.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The watching or the talking?
-Yeah. Every part of it.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:14.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
I --

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:17.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
This filmmaker, Neil Berkeley,
came up to me.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said,

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:23.023
"I´ve always wanted to do a
Gilbert Gottfried documentary."

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.891
And I said, "Well, you should

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:28.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
set your dreams
a lot higher than that."

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But then he made
this wonderful film.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
You -- One of the things
we found out --

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to mention
that clip real quick.

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.336
You are a hoarder, it seems.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:39.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, I could be
on any one of those shows.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-It´s like --

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:46.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
See, I think mainly
anything I can get for free.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.249
If someone came up and said,

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:53.620
"I´ve got a carton of
sanitary napkins" or something,

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.955 size:78% position:39%
I´d go, "Okay, yeah."

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´d take that?

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´m sure I could find
a use for those.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your children,
your wife are in the film?

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:06.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do your children
think you are funny?

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:10.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My son,
when he was in preschool,

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:14.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
the teacher said,
"He´s always --

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:16.242
He doesn´t pay attention.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he´s always trying
to crack jokes."

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:23.283
And I thought, "Yeah, I´m going
to really beat him for this.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:26.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. I don´t know
where he gets this from."

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:31.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she said, "Where´d you
learn how to be funny?"

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.159
And he said, "From my daddy."

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she said,
"Oh, your daddy´s funny?"

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:38.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
He goes, "He´s funny at home,
not at work."

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:39.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He heckled you.
-Uh, yes.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He heckled you to a teacher.
-Yeah.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:45.738
And I have to respect anyone

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
who doesn´t admire me
as a performer.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.378 size:84% position:42%
You talk about a couple
of incidents where you

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:56.182 size:84% position:42%
have gotten in trouble
for jokes that you did.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.550
One of them, I believe --

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Luckily,
it stayed out of the press.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.788 size:81% position:41%
-Yeah. You have had --

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.057
-And it stayed off the Internet.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:08.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One was you told a 9/11 joke
right after --

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
right after 9/11
at a Hugh Hefner roast.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It was --

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:17.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like a couple of days
after September 11th.

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:19.906
People are booing and hissing.

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.475
One guy yelled out, "Too soon."

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:25.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which I thought meant I didn´t
take a long enough pause

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:30.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
between the setup
and the punch line.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I figure

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
why not go to the
bottom level of hell?

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:38.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go in,
I tell the Aristocrats joke.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.360 size:75% position:38%
-Now, this is funny.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.061 size:81% position:41%
Because we´re talking
about one documentary,

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
but the telling
of The Aristocrats joke

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.765
led to a different documentary
about the history of the joke.

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:48.268
Yeah, it´s called
"The Aristocrats," oddly enough.

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:51.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that was --
That´s sort of a filthy joke.

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:54.507 size:81% position:41%
And it sort of won --
You won the room back.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:58.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It showed, like,
in situations like that,

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.880 size:78% position:39%
people need to laugh.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.116
They really want to laugh.

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:06.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
In the documentary,

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:10.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
there´s a part
where I´m doing a benefit

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.292 size:84% position:42%
at St. Jude´s Hospital,

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:16.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is by no stretch
a funny place.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course not.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s, like,
a children´s hospital.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I went up --

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:26.272
I thought, for sure, this would
destroy what I had of a career.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:27.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people were --

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
It did great.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:32.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
´Cause people
desperately want to laugh.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.947 size:78% position:39%
-And breaking tension

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:36.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
is sort of the root
of what it is that you do.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:39.919
I want to ask, because the Emmys
were just last night,

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.554
Two nights ago, I should say.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:43.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
You hosted the ´91 Emmys.
-Yes.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:46.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they had to put you
on a delay, yes?

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:50.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I think --
I think I´m the reason --

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.965 size:78% position:39%
I think, before that,

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:54.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
they didn´t have a delay
with the Emmys.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I´m pretty sure
afterwards --

00:03:56.402 --> 00:04:00.306 size:84% position:42%
Because it was the year
that Pee-wee Herman --

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:05.011
he was in a porn theater doing
what people do in porn theaters.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-He was playing with pee-wee.

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:10.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
And --

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.019
And, so, I went on stage.

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:17.090
And I said,
"I really sleep better at night

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
knowing Pee-wee Herman´s
been arrested.

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:22.095
If masturbation´s a crime,

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:24.530
I should be on death row."

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.702 size:78% position:39%
And how did they know
he was masturbating?

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.904
Did they dust for prints?

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:36.242
And, you know, and right now --

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:41.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
And to think that by age 12,
I was already Al Capone.

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:43.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:45.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you could put a charcoal
in my right hand,

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:49.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I´ll crush it
into a diamond.

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:52.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was never invited back
to the Emmys.

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:55.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. There you go.
Their loss.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:57.163
I promise you, it´s their loss.

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:58.831 size:78% position:39%
We could have used it
a couple nights ago.

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.667 size:81% position:41%
We all would have been
very happy with that.

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:02.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-Congrats on the documentary.

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:05.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
Always a pleasure.

